{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54345","headline":"中书遇雨 · 钱珝","name":"中书遇雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"济旱惟宸虑，爲霖即上台。\n云衔七曜起，雨拂九门来。\n纶阁飞丝度，龙渠激溜回。\n色翻池上藻，香裛鼎前杯。\n湘燕皆舒翼，沙鳞岂曝腮。\n尺波应爲假，虞海载沿洄。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}